Package: ShinyCellModular
Title: Modular Shiny App for Single Cell Data Exploration
Version: 1.0.1.59
Authors@R: person("Laura", "Perlaza-Jimenez", , "laura.perlaza-jimenez@monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A modular version of ShinyCell developed at the Monash Genomics and Bioinformatics Platform (MGBP). Each module is a self-contained tab in the
                 app. Supports large scRNAseq and multimodal datasets with fast on-demand HDF5 access, extended visualisations, improved filtering, and
                 publication-ready plots. Its modular structure makes it flexible, scalable, and easy to customise.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
